'''Phoenix''' is a [[:Category:Godly|godly]] [[:Category:Pets|pet]] that was originally obtainable by purchasing the [[8-Bit Item Pack]] for 899 Robux. It is now only obtainable through trading as the [[Gamepasses|gamepass]] has since gone offsale.  
== Appearance ==
Phoenix resembles a pixelated bird. Its pallet is orange and yellow while its broad wings have mini V shaped curves on them. When a player has the phoenix equipped, it flies behind them leaving a trail of yellow fire.

== Trivia ==
* This is one of three Phoenix pets in [[Murder Mystery 2]]. The other two are [[Frostbird]] and [[Ice Phoenix]].
* This pet also came with [[Pixel]], a [[Godly Weapons|godly]] knife, and an exclusive [[Effects|effect]] called [[Bitsplosion]].
* It partners with the [[Godly Weapons|godly]] knife [[Pixel]].
* Its model derives from the Roblox gear [https://www.roblox.com/catalog/163355404/8-Bit-Phoenix 8 Bit Phoenix], purchasable from the avatar shop for 500 Robux.

